			不能替代对高频日志源的治理。
			Maximum logs buffered by one component in a tick. Higher values increase component memory and
			log bursts and do not replace fixing excessive log producers.
		-->
		<tick_max_buffered_logs> 131070 </tick_max_buffered_logs>

		<!-- 单个组件一个 Tick 同步给 Logger 的日志数量；0 表示同步全部。设置上限可平滑内部网络
			和磁盘 IO，但会增加组件侧日志积压及内存占用。
			Logs sent from one component to Logger per tick; zero sends all. A limit smooths internal network
